page('publications.html','Selected publications','Eight selected journal publications by Anthony Nash, including first-author research in Bioinformatics, Matrix Biology Plus and Proteins.',publications)
page('education.html','Education','Education of Dr Anthony Nash: PhD, MSc Mathematical Biology and Biophysical Chemistry, MSc Natural Computing and undergraduate study in artificial intelligence.',education)
